            PDF files are widely used due to their portability, universal compatibility, and consistent formatting across devices. However, PDFs containing sensitive information can be vulnerable if not properly protected. Adding a password to your PDF adds an extra layer of security, preventing unauthorized access and maintaining confidentiality.
        </p>

        <p>
