        </p>

        <p>
            Whether you are a professional handling business documents, a student with personal notes, or anyone looking to safeguard important PDFs, this tool provides a simple, reliable, and secure solution.
        </p>

        <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Step-by-Step Guide to Add a Password to Your PDF</h2>

