            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Enter a strong password</strong>: Type in a secure password that will protect your PDF. Make sure to use a combination of letters, numbers, and symbols to make it hard to guess.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Click “Protect PDF”</strong>: Once your password is set, click the button to encrypt your PDF file. The process is completed in seconds without compromising file quality.
