        <h2 class="fw-semibold mt-5">Conclusion</h2>

        <p>
            Protecting your PDF files has never been easier. Our online PDF password protection tool allows you to encrypt documents quickly, securely, and for free. Whether for personal, academic, or professional use, you can confidently share sensitive PDFs knowing they are safe from unauthorized access.
        </p>

        <p>
            No downloads, no registration, and no hidden fees—just a fast, reliable, and secure way to protect your PDFs online. Start safeguarding your documents today and enjoy peace of mind knowing your information is secure.
